hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"258","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, main din mein sattar se zyada bar Allah se maghfirat mangta aur tauba karta hun. [Istighfar ki fazeelat]"
"259","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae logo! Allah se tauba karo; main din mein us se sau bar tauba karta hun. [Istighfar ki fazeelat]"
"260","[AI-translation] Us ke siwa koi mabud nahin aise zinda, qayam rakhne wale Allah se maghfirat chahta aur us ki taraf tauba karta hun. [Istighfar]"
"261","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rab bande ke sab se qareeb aakhri raat ke darmiyan hota hai; agar is ghadi Allah ke zikr walon mein ho sako to ho jao. [Raat ke zikr ki fazeelat]"
"262","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Banda apne Rab ke sab se qareeb sajde mein hota hai; dua kasrat se karo. [Sajde mein dua ki fazeelat]"
"263","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak mere dil par ghaflat aati hai aur main din mein sau bar Allah se maghfirat mangta hun. [Istighfar ki fazeelat]"
